  "description": "Ten years after the Tower of Infinity appeared across the world, Lee Kanghan, a man with a peculiar constitution that gave him a muscular physique just by sleeping, awakened as the Heavenly Demon.\n\n*\\[Heavenly Demonic Physique (Rank: F–SSS)\\]*\n\nBut something about the ranking seemed off.\n\n*\"Is this… actually weak?\"*\n\n…As if that were possible.\n\n*\\[Notice: Player \"Lee Kanghan\" has achieved the \"World's First S-Rank\" achievement.\\]\n\n\\[Notice: Player \"Lee Kanghan\" has achieved the \"World's First...\\]*\n\nThe weak ones were his opponents... for they were the enemies of the Heavenly Demon.\n\n(Source: Toyou's Dream Website, translated)",
